// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1940095836" "Our scouts have noticed an increase in Dreg activity along the southern edges of Eltentown. They're known to hole up in some of the ruined skyscrapers in the sunken city, using them as temporary bases to launch raids against our people. This has to stop; we need to send a message to the Dregs that their presence won't be tolerated."
// AcceptString :
"P2438512259" "Send a message to the Dregs that they are not welcome in Eltentown."
// SendOffString :
"P3372749602" "We tracked them back to one of their hideouts. Show them as little mercy as they show us."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P275525593" "Bring the pain to the Dregs."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2008815508" "The longer you wait the more brazen the Dregs become."
// TaskTitle :
"P1453499806" "<font face=title><color orange>DREG SLAVERS OPERATING WITH IMPUNITY</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1254857083" "This building stinks of Dregs and their filth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1209066483" "You've certainly sent the Dregs a message they won't soon forget."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_G_Task2b 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1632859341" "We lose more people to D.U.S.T. Ranger activity than to any other cause. To the Cole Administration, the Eltentowners exist simply to serve as shooting practice. We've got to level the field and show them that their actions will not go unpunished."
// AcceptString :
"P822235831" "Show the D.U.S.T. Rangers that they have reason to fear Eltentown."
// SendOffString :
"P2309025535" "D.U.S.T. Rangers are relatively easy to find. <color orange>You can find them all over the eastern half of Eltentown.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P379243446" "Thin the ranks of the D.U.S.T."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2698063127" "We lost another one of our citizens to a D.U.S.T. attack; why have you not dealt with them yet?"
// TaskTitle :
"P3686209312" "<font face=title><color orange>CULLING THE RANKS OF THE D.U.S.T.</color></font>"
// VillainDescription :
"P3880754834" "Defeat {Remain} D.U.S.T. soldiers"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P3474027969" "One D.U.S.T. soldier to defeat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3064052168" "The D.U.S.T. Ranger radio bands are buzzing with the results of your attack. They've received word to withdraw from the area. For now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_G_Task2c 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2177594121" "Those howls you hear at night: Ghouls. People here believe that some of the strange disappearances are because of Ghouls. We euthanize as many as we can find, but their numbers just seem to grow. We need to keep them in check or they'll be overrunning the Compound before we know it."
// AcceptString :
"P2906838267" "Eliminate the Ghoul menace."
// SendOffString :
"P2440556501" "Don't hold back. I know they were human once, but any trace of that is gone. They're just monsters now..."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2350708524" "Euthanize the Ghouls."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P442987248" "Have you done as I asked? We're still hearing those Ghoul howls."
// TaskTitle :
"P1211302193" "<font face=title><color orange>DESTROY THE GHOULS</color></font>"
// VillainDescription :
"P3063636934" "Defeat {Remain} Ghouls"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P1309203712" "One Ghoul to defeat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3309570668" "Not hearing Ghouls in the night is a comfort to the people here. Thank you."

