// IntroString :
"P4218125214" "Rumor has it that a group of <color yellow>Shepherds</color> called <color red>{GROUP_NAME}</color> have discovered an undetonated Bio-Weapon from the Hamidon Wars in a destroyed underground lab. Their leader <color red>{BOSS_NAME}</color> plans to bring the weapon to the surface and detonate it in order to <i>'save us all from our wretched fate'</i>. Someone needs to stop {BOSS_NAME} and {GROUP_NAME} from getting that bomb, and I can think of no one better suited to do it than you, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P1937486245" "Stop {GROUP_NAME}"
// SendOffString :
"P1357625876" "The Bio-Weapons used during the Hamidon Wars were terrible things. You can't let {GROUP_NAME} get that weapon or a lot of people are going to die."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3158591776" "Stop Shepherds from recovering the Bio-Weapon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4164757405" "There's no time to lose. Every wasted minute is one closer to a catastrophe!"
// TaskTitle :
"P52058066" "<font face=title><color orange>DISARM THE BIO-WEAPON</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3056299952" "You navigate a maze of collapsed maintenance corridors before finally finding your way into the destroyed lab."

