// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1342802867" "Some <color red>Dregs</color> have been giving us problems here in Eltentown, ambushing our scroungers in broad daylight, or stealing people from the shelters in the night. I want you to show them what happens when the strong do as they please to them, and maybe they'll realize we need to work together to survive rather than working only for ourselves."
// AcceptString :
"P3639435694" "Put the hurt on the Dregs"
// SendOffString :
"P349714914" "The Dregs are out and out ruthless. They prey on the weak because they believe that the only thing that matters here in the gumbo is strength. Show them real strength.<br><br>Obviously you could just beat all their faces in, <color orange>or you could just destroy their supplies and free any slaves they've captured.</color> That should teach them how it feels to have everything taken from them and nobody to rely on but themselves."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1103736977" "I hope that a good thrashing will show the Dregs that working <b>with</b> us, rather than against us, will serve everyone's best interests."
// TaskTitle :
"P3269630756" "<font face=title><color orange>DREGS CAUSING PROBLEMS</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P519747541" "These Dregs think they're king of the hill here in First Ward. Time to dethrone them."

