// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2138947686" "We have a bad situation here. A <color yellow>Last Worder</color> by the name of <color yellow>{CRIMINAL_NAME}</color> got in a heated argument with a group of Shepherds called <color red>{GROUP_NAME}</color> and wound up killing one of 'em. Not surprisingly {GROUP_NAME} is very upset and is demanding {CRIMINAL_NAME} to be handed over to pay for his crime or they'll attack the Compound, but he's on the run.<br><br>I've learned that {CRIMINAL_NAME} is friends with the <color red>Dregs</color> who have hidden him in an abandoned office outside of the Compound.<br><br>I want you to bring him in and own up to his actions rather than hide and let others take the heat for him. I'm sure we can work something out with {GROUP_NAME}."
// AcceptString :
"P388533403" "Bring {CRIMINAL_NAME} to gumbo justice"
// SendOffString :
"P3681458849" "No Last Worder in his or her right mind would give in to the demands of {GROUP_NAME}, but they'd just as soon do that then go after the Dregs. {CRIMINAL_NAME} is guilty of murder and his actions are risking the lives of every Last Worder in Eltentown. I think you are the only option here."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3814373055" "Bring the criminal to gumbo justice"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P576564842" "Knowledge of where {CRIMINAL_NAME} is hiding could get back to the Dregs any time and they might move him."
// TaskTitle :
"P752530034" "<font face=title><color orange>THE SHEPHERDS ARE ANGRY</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2458133827" "This place certainly smells like a Dregs hideout."

