// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1024795915" "It's well known here in the gumbo that going into the underground is pretty much a death sentence. The place is infested by <color red>Ghouls</color> and they've started to crawl out onto the streets at night, making it even more dangerous than it is already with Dreg slavers and D.U.S.T. kill teams stalking around.<br><br>Well, it's about to get even worse. Reports from Imperial City have suggested that a wave of Ghouls has been spotted migrating south through some old Lethe channels. We sent some observers down to watch the tunnels for Ghoul activity. <color orange>They've all reported back except for {TEAM_NAME}</color>.<br><br>I can't be positive what has happened to {TEAM_NAME}, but I don't want to lose hope for them. I want you to go down and see if you can find them and get them back topside. Nobody deserves to be eaten by Ghouls."
// AcceptString :
"P2552152954" "Rescue {TEAM_NAME} in the tunnels"
// SendOffString :
"P3382978011" "These are the last known coordinates for {TEAM_NAME}. If you run into Ghouls there are a few things I need you to do. First, if you can <color orange>eliminate the Alpha Ghoul</color> it will disrupt them as they fight for dominance and choose a new one. Second, our Resistance allies are jacked into the Static, if you can <color orange>find a Static box in the area and relay a message</color>, that will help us pinpoint where the Ghouls are. Third, I want you to <color orange>get {TEAM_NAME} out of there</color>.<br><br>We'll be busy topside preparing for the onslaught. Information and time are what we need, but if you can put a dent into those Ghouls, all the better."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P927954297" "Find the Ghouls, Rescue the Observers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2039716866" "I've seen a pack of Ghouls strip a man down to a pile of bones inside of five minutes, best you hurry."
// TaskTitle :
"P502141165" "<font face=title><color orange>THE GHOULS ARE COMING!</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
