// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3405797527" "D.U.S.T. has been getting bold lately and sending teams further and further from the Free-Fire Zone where they are in control. Hitting their sweep teams here in Eltentown will just incite them to send out more patrols. <color orange>I want you to head into the FFZ and hit them where they think they're safest</color>. That should force them to reconsider their security and pull back for awhile."
// AcceptString :
"P1780183115" "Attack D.U.S.T. in the FFZ"
// SendOffString :
"P382703120" "If you take out two squads worth; about 10 men total, then that should do the trick. Remember, it has to be in the Free-Fire Zone in order for this plan to work."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1374625160" "Attack D.U.S.T. in the Free-Fire Zone"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P339187982" "D.U.S.T. has the FFZ completely under their control, or so they think. Prove them wrong."
// TaskTitle :
"P3575706829" "<font face=title><color orange>D.U.S.T. IS GROWING BOLDER</color></font>"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P1199243830" "One D.U.S.T. soldier to defeat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P590808355" "You've forced D.U.S.T. to reconsider their bold expansion into Eltentown!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_G_Task10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2953830209" "Our friends in the Carnival have requested your help by name, {HeroName}. They need your assistance in recovering something magical from some group called the <color red>Midnight Masters</color>. This is way beyond me, so I'll just give you the location and send you on your way."
// AcceptString :
"P3427356092" "Recover magic relic for the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P659594832" "All I know is that if the Carnival needs your help against these guys, then they are bad news. Be careful, First Ward needs you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2486059958" "From the sound of it these Midnight guys won't stick around for much longer. I'd hustle if I were you."
// TaskTitle :
"P326375109" "<font face=title><color orange>CARNIVAL NEEDS YOUR HELP</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
