// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ShepherdPlanClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1951946545" "The Plan"
// DetailString :
"P4094044955" "According to the contents of this box, which contains remote detonators and resistance pamphlets, {GROUP_NAME} planned on framing the Carnival with a bomb plot against D.U.S.T.  These detonators were to be affixed to barrels of fuel throughout the building and blown once D.U.S.T. arrived. The result of such a plan would most certainly have brought D.U.S.T. down hard on the Carnival here in First Ward, as well as the Last Worders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P763493084" "Shepherds of {GROUP_NAME} have fled a recent ambush against D.U.S.T. where they killed a half dozen D.U.S.T. leaders. They holed up in an old office building in the Free-Fire Zone but D.U.S.T. sweep teams are going to find them at any moment. I want you to get in there and find out what exactly {GROUP_NAME} is planning. <color orange>Search for evidence of their plans and then finish off {BOSS_NAME}, their leader</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P2481792769" "Determine what {GROUP_NAME} is up to."
// SendOffString :
"P381213096" "D.U.S.T. won't take kindly to their comrades getting killed. They don't distinguish between Shepherds and Last Worders, and I'm afraid that retribution might come our way if we don't take matters into our own hands."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2631041772" "Take down Shepherds before D.U.S.T. can"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2748025725" "{GROUP_NAME} won't last very long against a concerted D.U.S.T. assault. Get in there while there is still time and find out what they're up to before D.U.S.T. obliterates them."
// TaskTitle :
"P2792957975" "<font face=title><color orange>SHEPHERDS ARE UP TO SOMETHING</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3084017092" "You evade a few D.U.S.T. sweep teams and silence a Shepherd sentry as you slip into the building, time to find out what {GROUP_NAME} is up to."

